---
// The 1423 story, told in one breath, with the one loud element on the page: the
// yellow Q flag, which ships flew to say they were in quarantine.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <h1>AI agents are the new plague ships.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        In 1423 Venice stopped letting ships sail straight into the city. Their cargo waited
        on an island, the lazaretto, until inspectors cleared it. Contaminated goods were
        burned. Clean goods came ashore.
      </p>
      <p class="lede">
        Lazaret does the same for your API. Every write waits in a ledger at the edge, an
        independent Claude reviewer inspects it, and only what passes reaches your database.
        The reviewer can only judge; it has no way to act.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#demo">Try an attack</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/Gleato/lazaret">Read the code</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="mast" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 220 420" role="presentation">
        <line x1="40" y1="8" x2="40" y2="412" class="pole"></line>
        <circle cx="40" cy="8" r="6" class="truck"></circle>
        <rect x="44" y="24" width="154" height="112" class="qflag"></rect>
      </svg>
      <figcaption class="sans">
        Q, the yellow jack. A ship flying it is held until it is cleared.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 7vw, 96px) clamp(48px, 8vw, 104px);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(160px, 0.42fr);
    gap: clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(var(--t4), 7vw, 5.2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    max-width: 13ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--t1);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
  }
  .mast {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .mast svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .pole {
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 5;
  }
  .truck {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .qflag {
    fill: var(--q);
    transform-origin: 44px 80px;
    animation: hoist 1.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) both;
  }
  .mast figcaption {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--t-1);
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  /* The page's single orchestrated moment: the flag is hoisted once, on load. */
  @keyframes hoist {
    from {
      transform: translateY(260px) scaleY(0.6);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      transform: none;
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .mast {
      order: -1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .mast svg {
      width: 72px;
    }
  }
</style>
